   "text": "[x] Research: 10+ tools, final gap check\n[x] Vision, features, architecture docs\n[x] Roadmap + threat model draft\n[x] ADRs 0001-0006 accepted\n    (AGPL, Go, outbound agent, Caddy,\n     SvelteKit, MCP-first AI)\n[x] 13 wireframe screens\n[x] Agent team (10 agents)\n[ ] Repo skeleton + CI\n[ ] Footprint bench on a 1 GB VM\n[ ] Spike 1: Go + Caddy + SQLite binary\n[ ] Spike 2: outbound agent + logs\n[ ] Threat model review\n\nExit: <= 80 MB idle, measured",
   "originalText": "[x] Research: 10+ tools, final gap check\n[x] Vision, features, architecture docs\n[x] Roadmap + threat model draft\n[x] ADRs 0001-0006 accepted\n    (AGPL, Go, outbound agent, Caddy,\n     SvelteKit, MCP-first AI)\n[x] 13 wireframe screens\n[x] Agent team (10 agents)\n[ ] Repo skeleton + CI\n[ ] Footprint bench on a 1 GB VM\n[ ] Spike 1: Go + Caddy + SQLite binary\n[ ] Spike 2: outbound agent + logs\n[ ] Threat model review\n\nExit: <= 80 MB idle, measured",
