   "text": "- Install, setup token, admin + 2FA, onboarding\n- Action registry + audit log\n- Deploy: image, Dockerfile, Compose\n- GitHub push-to-deploy\n- Blue-green, health gate, auto-rollback\n- Stop-first for stateful apps\n- Domains, auto HTTPS, diagnostics, IPv6\n- Secrets, registry logins, volumes, network\n- Postgres/MySQL/Redis + S3 backups\n- Metrics, logs per deploy, alerts\n- Per-app CPU/RAM limits, disk cleanup\n- Self-update, update notices, uninstall\n- REST API + read-only MCP\n\nExit: first app on HTTPS < 5 min",
   "originalText": "- Install, setup token, admin + 2FA, onboarding\n- Action registry + audit log\n- Deploy: image, Dockerfile, Compose\n- GitHub push-to-deploy\n- Blue-green, health gate, auto-rollback\n- Stop-first for stateful apps\n- Domains, auto HTTPS, diagnostics, IPv6\n- Secrets, registry logins, volumes, network\n- Postgres/MySQL/Redis + S3 backups\n- Metrics, logs per deploy, alerts\n- Per-app CPU/RAM limits, disk cleanup\n- Self-update, update notices, uninstall\n- REST API + read-only MCP\n\nExit: first app on HTTPS < 5 min",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
