   "text": "- Remote agents (NAT ok), builder servers\n- Railpack; GitLab, Gitea, Bitbucket\n- PR previews, environments, promote\n- Web terminal; Docker resources view\n- CI-tested templates + auto-update policies\n- Static sites, TCP/UDP, Cloudflare Tunnel\n- One-off run, release phase, cron\n- MongoDB, ClickHouse, DB upgrades\n- Minimal multi-user; serverdock.toml\n- Adopt existing stacks; move apps\n- CLI; MCP write actions + approval\n\nExit: 3 servers (1 behind NAT),\nremote agent <= 50 MB",
   "originalText": "- Remote agents (NAT ok), builder servers\n- Railpack; GitLab, Gitea, Bitbucket\n- PR previews, environments, promote\n- Web terminal; Docker resources view\n- CI-tested templates + auto-update policies\n- Static sites, TCP/UDP, Cloudflare Tunnel\n- One-off run, release phase, cron\n- MongoDB, ClickHouse, DB upgrades\n- Minimal multi-user; serverdock.toml\n- Adopt existing stacks; move apps\n- CLI; MCP write actions + approval\n\nExit: 3 servers (1 behind NAT),\nremote agent <= 50 MB",
